  diseaseId: influenza
  diseaseName: "GR\u0130P"
  generalInfo: "Grip, influenza vir\xFCs\xFCn\xFCn neden oldu\u011Fu bula\u015F\u0131c\u0131
    bir \xFCst solunum yolu hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda ate\u015F,
    halsizlik, \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk ve kas a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen
    belirtilerdendir."
  symptomsInfo: "Y\xFCksek ate\u015F, kuru \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk var olmas\u0131, halsizlik
    ve k\u0131rg\u0131nl\u0131k var olmas\u0131 ve belirgin kas a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131
    gripte s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131 hastalarda hafif burun
    ak\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 ve bo\u011Faz a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  diagnosisTips: "Akut ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 mevcut olmas\u0131, \xFCst solunum
    belirtisi mevcut olmas\u0131 ve temas \xF6yk\xFCs\xFC mevcut olmas\u0131 viral
    enfeksiyon lehine \xF6nemli bulgulard\u0131r. Ate\u015Fin h\u0131zl\u0131 y\xFCkselmesi
    grip tan\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 destekleyebilir."
  diseaseImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 191aac3ac38f4d343babb8a63a313415, type: 3}
